  "prefLabel": "Bfa 102.04 Management",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bfa 102.04 Management. The powers of the authority shall be vested, pursuant to RSA 162-A, in a board of directors. Such power shall be delegated with regard to the business and affairs of the authority as consistent with RSA 162-A.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Bfa 100) #5719, eff 10-13-93",
